<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Neutral">>
Ramu: Captain all ok?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Disappointed">>
Raju: I let you and the team down - I am not ready.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
